---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ClosingCTA from '../components/ClosingCTA.astro';
import { socials } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout description="I’m Rohit Kumar, founder of Leadomi. I build websites, custom software and SaaS, APIs, and automations to help businesses win leads and save time.">
  <section class="about-hero page-shell"><div class="about-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker" data-reveal>About / My story</p><h1 data-reveal>Founder of Leadomi.<br /><em>I build to solve problems.</em></h1><p data-reveal>For the past three years, I’ve built websites, custom software, SaaS, APIs, and automations to help businesses get more leads, save time, and keep growing.</p><div class="about-links" data-reveal>{socials.map((social) => <a href={social.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{social.label} <Icon name="external" /></a>)}</div></div><div class="about-portrait-wrap" data-reveal><div class="about-portrait"><img src="/images/rohit.webp" alt="Rohit Kumar" fetchpriority="high" /></div><div class="about-portrait-caption"><span>LEARNING FAST</span><span>BUILDING DAILY ↘</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="about-story page-shell"><div class="story-label" data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>01</span> How I build</p><span>START WITH THE PROBLEM</span></div><div class="story-body" data-reveal><h2>Start with what’s not working.</h2><p>Maybe good leads are slipping away. Maybe a task takes too long. I start by finding the problem, then build a website, custom software, an API, or an automation to fix it.</p><p><a href="https://leadomi.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Leadomi</a> helps trade businesses follow up after missed calls. <a href="https://otpwala.me" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">OTP Wala</a> helps people find a number for SMS verification without as much guesswork. Each product is built around a real need.</p><p>I keep learning about AI and new tools. I use them when they save time or make the product better.</p><div class="about-quickfacts" aria-label="My experience at a glance"><div><strong>03</strong><span>Years building</span></div><div><strong>02</strong><span>Products built</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="principles-section page-shell"><div data-reveal><p class="section-kicker"><span>02</span> How I work</p><h2>Listen first.<br /><em>Build what helps.</em></h2></div><div class="principle-grid"><article data-reveal><span>01 / Listen</span><h3>Find the problem.</h3><p>I ask what’s costing time, losing leads, or getting in the customer’s way.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>02 / Learn</span><h3>Use the right tools.</h3><p>I keep up with AI and new tools, then pick what fits the job.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>03 / Build</span><h3>Make it ready to use.</h3><p>I build, test, and get the solution ready for your team and customers.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="education-row page-shell" data-reveal><div><p class="section-kicker"><span>03</span> Founder & builder</p><h2>Building products.<br /><em>Solving real problems.</em></h2></div><div class="education-items"><article><span>FOUNDER</span><strong>Leadomi</strong><small>Lead follow-up for UK trade businesses</small></article><article><span>PRODUCT BUILT</span><strong>OTP Wala</strong><small>SMS verification made easier to navigate</small></article><article><span>EXPERIENCE</span><strong>3 years</strong><small>Web development & automation</small></article></div></section>
  <ClosingCTA number="04" />
</BaseLayout>
